                  <th className="p-4 font-bold text-emerald-950 w-3/8 bg-emerald-50/50 border-l border-emerald-100 font-serif">公的本人確認（eKYC）【有償】</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody className="divide-y divide-slate-100">
